{"seq":1,"slug":"ventilation-indoor-air-quality","title":"通风与室内空气品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/air-moisture-frontiers/ventilation-indoor-air-quality","wordCount":1385,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"通风与室内空气品质\">通风与室内空气品质</h1><p>一间坐满人、门窗紧闭两小时的会议室，会让人犯困、头沉、注意力涣散——不是缺氧，而是二氧化碳和各种污染物在累积，新鲜空气没跟上。新冠之后，室内空气品质（IAQ）从&quot;舒适问题&quot;升级为&quot;健康问题&quot;，通风成为公共卫生的一线工具。本篇讲通风的物理机制、新风量与换气次数、污染物控制，以及通风与能耗这对老对头的权衡。它直接承接热环境一章——通风既换气也换热。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-通风的两种动力\">核心概念：通风的两种动力</h2><p>通风的本质是用室外空气置换被污染的室内空气，动力来源分两类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自然通风</strong>：靠风压与热压驱动，零能耗。<strong>风压</strong>来自建筑迎风面正压、背风面负压的差异；<strong>热压（烟囱效应）</strong> 来自室内外温差导致的空气密度差，暖空气上升从高处排出、冷空气从低处补入。热压驱动的压差为：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta P = \\rho_o\\, g\\, h\\left(\\frac{T_i - T_o}{T_i}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是进排风口高差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是室内外温度（K）。高差越大、温差越大，自然通风越强——这是中庭、天井、通风塔的物理依据。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>机械通风</strong>：靠风机强制送排风，可控、稳定、不受气候摆布，但耗电。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Wind[室外风] --&gt;|风压| NV[自然通风]&#10;  Temp[室内外温差] --&gt;|热压 烟囱效应| NV&#10;  NV --&gt; Air((室内空气置换))&#10;  Fan[送排风机] --&gt;|机械通风| Air&#10;  Air --&gt; Out[排出污染空气]&#10;  Fresh[引入新风] --&gt; Air&#10;  HR[热回收 换热不换气] -.-&gt;|回收排风冷热量| Fresh\">flowchart TD\n  Wind[室外风] --&gt;|风压| NV[自然通风]\n  Temp[室内外温差] --&gt;|热压 烟囱效应| NV\n  NV --&gt; Air((室内空气置换))\n  Fan[送排风机] --&gt;|机械通风| Air\n  Air --&gt; Out[排出污染空气]\n  Fresh[引入新风] --&gt; Air\n  HR[热回收 换热不换气] -.-&gt;|回收排风冷热量| Fresh</pre><p>现实中常用<strong>混合通风</strong>：过渡季靠自然通风省能，极端气候切换机械通风保品质，这与 <a href=\"../thermal-energy/thermal-comfort\">热舒适</a> 中适应性模型放宽的舒适窗口正好配合——舒适区越宽，自然通风可用的时间越长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"室内空气污染物与新风量\">室内空气污染物与新风量</h2><p>室内空气里潜伏着多种污染物，各有来源与对策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>污染物</th>\n<th>主要来源</th>\n<th>健康影响</th>\n<th>控制手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CO2</td>\n<td>人体呼吸</td>\n<td>困倦、认知下降</td>\n<td>加大新风量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PM2.5</td>\n<td>室外渗入、烹饪</td>\n<td>呼吸/心血管</td>\n<td>过滤（如 F7/H 级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VOC/甲醛</td>\n<td>装修材料、家具</td>\n<td>刺激、致癌</td>\n<td>源头减排、通风稀释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>病原气溶胶</td>\n<td>人呼出</td>\n<td>呼吸道传染</td>\n<td>高换气、过滤、UV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氡</td>\n<td>土壤、建材</td>\n<td>肺癌</td>\n<td>底层防渗、通风</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CO2 浓度是室内通风是否充足的便捷指示器（人是主要源），通常以约 1000 ppm 作为新风充足与否的参考线。新风需求用<strong>新风量</strong>（每人每小时多少立方米）或<strong>换气次数 ACH</strong>（每小时换气体积与房间体积之比）衡量。新冠后，许多场所把换气次数目标显著提高（例如室内公共空间普遍倡导 ACH 提升到 4–6 次乃至更高），并强调过滤等级与气流组织。</p>\n<h2 id=\"气流组织-通风效率的关键\">气流组织：通风效率的关键</h2><p>同样的新风量，送风口怎么布置，决定它是真&quot;洗&quot;了人的呼吸区还是&quot;短路&quot;直奔排风口。气流组织（送排风口位置、送风温度与速度）决定<strong>通风效率</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>混合通风（上送上回）</strong>：高速送风与室内空气充分混合，温度均匀，但稀释式置换效率一般。</li>\n<li><strong>置换通风（下送上回）</strong>：低速从地板附近送入凉爽新风，靠人体与设备的热羽流把污浊空气抬升到顶部排出，呼吸区空气最新鲜，能效与 IAQ 俱佳，是当代趋势。</li>\n<li><strong>个性化送风</strong>：直接向工位呼吸区送风，用最少新风获得最佳个人体验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>气流组织还直接影响 <a href=\"../thermal-energy/thermal-comfort\">热舒适</a> 中的吹风感——送风速度过高就从&quot;换气&quot;变成了&quot;扰人&quot;，二者必须协同设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通风与能耗的权衡-热回收\">通风与能耗的权衡：热回收</h2><p>通风的代价是把室内调好温度的空气排掉、再加热或冷却引入的室外新风，这部分<strong>通风换气损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{vent}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 是 <a href=\"../thermal-energy/building-energy-balance\">建筑能量平衡与能耗</a> 里冬夏皆有的失热得热项。健康要多换气、节能要少换气，这对矛盾的破局点是<strong>热回收（能量回收）</strong>：</p>\n<p>让排出的脏空气与引入的新风在换热芯里换热（但不混合），把排风里的冷量/热量回收给新风。显热回收只换温度，全热回收同时换温度与湿度（在湿热地区尤为重要）。热回收效率常达 70%–85%，让&quot;高换气&quot;与&quot;低能耗&quot;得以兼得，是当代健康建筑的标配。</p>\n<p>此外，通风带入的湿空气一旦在围护结构内冷凝，又会引出下一篇 <a href=\"moisture-and-building-pathology\">湿度与建筑病理</a> 的问题——空气与水汽在建筑里从来是同一股物质流的两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>通风用室外空气置换污染空气，自然通风靠风压与热压（烟囱效应）零能耗，机械通风可控但耗电，混合通风兼取两者。</li>\n<li>室内污染物包括 CO2、PM2.5、VOC、病原气溶胶、氡等，CO2 是通风充足的便捷指示器，新风量用换气次数 ACH 衡量，疫后目标普遍提高。</li>\n<li>气流组织决定通风效率，置换通风把最新鲜空气送到呼吸区，能效与 IAQ 俱佳，但须与吹风感协同。</li>\n<li>通风换气损失是能量平衡的冬夏失热得热项，热回收（显热/全热）效率达 70%–85%，让高换气与低能耗兼得。</li>\n<li>通风与适应性舒适的宽舒适窗口配合可延长自然通风时段，通风带入的湿空气又牵出建筑病理问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通风与室内空气品质","id":"通风与室内空气品质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：通风的两种动力","id":"核心概念-通风的两种动力"},{"level":2,"text":"室内空气污染物与新风量","id":"室内空气污染物与新风量"},{"level":2,"text":"气流组织：通风效率的关键","id":"气流组织-通风效率的关键"},{"level":2,"text":"通风与能耗的权衡：热回收","id":"通风与能耗的权衡-热回收"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"建筑声学设计（厅堂）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/architectural-acoustics-design"},"next":{"title":"湿度与建筑病理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/air-moisture-frontiers/moisture-and-building-pathology"}}